OL,3,GNEWSAHome with hundreds of thousands of
OL,4,Acockroaches like a horror movie, pest
OL,5,Acontroller says
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of thousands of cockroaches
OL,8,Fwere found in a shared home in an
OL,9,Finfestation described as the worst the
OL,10,Fpest controller had seen in 38 years.
OL,12,FGareth Davies, who said the scene had
OL,13,Flooked like one from a "Stephen King
OL,14,Ffilm", said his team had used
OL,15,Fspecialist equipment to vacuum up
OL,16,F"hundreds of thousands" of cockroaches
OL,17,Ffrom the four bedroom property in
OL,18,FPontypridd, south Wales.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
