OL,3,GNEWSAHome with hundreds of thousands of
OL,4,Acockroaches like a horror movie, pest
OL,5,Acontroller says
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said his company had dealt with
OL,8,Fhundreds of cockroach jobs in the past
OL,9,F12 months, compared with just a handful
OL,10,Fa year five years ago.
OL,12,FThere have been reports of a rise in
OL,13,Fcockroach sightings across some of
OL,14,FBritain's urban areas, according to the
OL,15,FBritish Pest Control Association
OL,16,F(BPCA).
